# Patch 0914 (wish of DevJunior, 11.11.2026: skins for Ashley, Luis, Ada and the other characters; his approval of the
# extra 16 MB the same day; port/docs/npc-skins-plan.md). Not a bug of the prototype: a port feature of the mods.
# game/read.cpp readEmData: a character's archive (EmReadSearch: the partner, the people of the events, every enemy)
# that a mod pack replaces is read to a block of the mods' place above MEM1 (runtime/mod_place.cpp re4_mod_em_place,
# at least the file and the room's own size) instead of a block of the room's heap, which a skin of several MB does
# not find; its REL part is copied out when the room's size reaches over it, as with the heap's block. InitModule
# gives the block back (re4_mod_em_release). The disc's own files, and a mod's when the place is full, go as before.
